(3070414, 432747, 52130, '<td valign="top">hmm, another light on white repeat since I''m to assume that not too many people have a cool raggedy looking chair that is identical to the one in the adjacent challenge. I''ll tell you the same thing I told the other person who did this: "I don''t think entering 2 challenges with the same subject matter is very creative, but I suppose it isn''t controversial until the the 3rd when the light on white scores come in. So I won''t vote down for it."<br/> <br/>That being said...I really enjoy his image. The title, the composition, subject matter, and yes...even the diagonal. In fact, I think this image would have done better than your light on white entry. <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'hmm, another light on white repeat since I''m to assume that not too many people have a cool raggedy looking chair that is identical to the one in the adjacent challenge. I''ll tell you the same thing I told the other person who did this: "I don''t think entering 2 challenges with the same subject matter is very creative, but I suppose it isn''t controversial until the the 3rd when the light on white scores come in. So I won''t vote down for it." That being said...I really enjoy his image. The title, the composition, subject matter, and yes...even the diagonal. In fact, I think this image would have done better than your light on white entry. Good luck.', '2006-11-29 01:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
