(3073408, 431633, 56673, '<td valign="top">Not very strong on the diagonal element.  Also, a very small image.  Try to take advantage of the full 640 pixels if you can.</td>', 'Not very strong on the diagonal element.  Also, a very small image.  Try to take advantage of the full 640 pixels if you can.', '2006-11-29 19:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
