(3074019, 432762, 50355, '<td valign="top">I think the bee is a bit distracting.  Take that out and it could be a commercial picture.</td>', 'I think the bee is a bit distracting.  Take that out and it could be a commercial picture.', '2006-11-29 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074021, 432391, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I can''t wait to find out what it is.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I can''t wait to find out what it is.', '2006-11-29 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074022, 432203, 50355, '<td valign="top">Very, very sharp and clear and crisp!!</td>', 'Very, very sharp and clear and crisp!!', '2006-11-29 22:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074042, 431793, 66384, '<td valign="top">These are great little colorful structures. The diagonal works well.</td>', 'These are great little colorful structures. The diagonal works well.', '2006-11-29 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074046, 432718, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Love the colors, light, and reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Love the colors, light, and reflections.', '2006-11-29 22:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074047, 432650, 66384, '<td valign="top">Strange thing, but very nice lines and colors. Good use of diagonal.</td>', 'Strange thing, but very nice lines and colors. Good use of diagonal.', '2006-11-29 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074048, 431403, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job.</td>', 'Great job.', '2006-11-29 22:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074049, 432776, 60698, '<td valign="top">Creative image that really grabs your attention.</td>', 'Creative image that really grabs your attention.', '2006-11-29 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074056, 432067, 24454, '<td valign="top">This photo draws me in.  There''s just enough detail in the right places to give mystery to the child.  I am starting to really love this high contrast processing too!   I really like this.</td>', 'This photo draws me in.  There''s just enough detail in the right places to give mystery to the child.  I am starting to really love this high contrast processing too!   I really like this.', '2006-11-29 22:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074057, 432052, 60698, '<td valign="top">Pleasing diagonal lines. Simple earthy colors are great. Makes you wonder why they built this.</td>', 'Pleasing diagonal lines. Simple earthy colors are great. Makes you wonder why they built this.', '2006-11-29 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074059, 432124, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great capture with nice detail. Like the simple white background.</td>', 'Great capture with nice detail. Like the simple white background.', '2006-11-29 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074060, 432353, 66384, '<td valign="top">focus seems a little soft. the diagonals are good.</td>', 'focus seems a little soft. the diagonals are good.', '2006-11-29 22:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074061, 430633, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is simply amazing!  I can''t believe how much detail you can see in that eye -- which couldn''t be more than a half a pixel!  AMAZING!  I think I can even see little teeth :)   What a perfect photo for this challenge!  10</td>', 'This is simply amazing!  I can''t believe how much detail you can see in that eye -- which couldn''t be more than a half a pixel!  AMAZING!  I think I can even see little teeth :)   What a perfect photo for this challenge!  10', '2006-11-29 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074066, 432301, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how I love great moon shots!   Great choice for this challenge!  10</td>', 'Oh how I love great moon shots!   Great choice for this challenge!  10', '2006-11-29 22:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074068, 431448, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is a very lucky little girl!  I wish every little girl could be so lucky to have such obvious love and devotion for their child!  You''re awesome!   Oh. . .great photo too.  It doesn''t look posed, but more like a special moment was captured!</td>', 'That is a very lucky little girl!  I wish every little girl could be so lucky to have such obvious love and devotion for their child!  You''re awesome!   Oh. . .great photo too.  It doesn''t look posed, but more like a special moment was captured!', '2006-11-29 22:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074071, 432840, 23484, '<td valign="top">You have the diagonal there but it is too out of focus.</td>', 'You have the diagonal there but it is too out of focus.', '2006-11-29 22:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074072, 431722, 60698, '<td valign="top">Good diagonals. To add interest maybe the addition of a subject of some sort would help.</td>', 'Good diagonals. To add interest maybe the addition of a subject of some sort would help.', '2006-11-29 22:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074078, 432598, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really nice shot. The diagonal is great and I like the whole feeling of it.  I just wish the focus was better.</td>', 'I think this is a really nice shot. The diagonal is great and I like the whole feeling of it.  I just wish the focus was better.', '2006-11-29 22:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074086, 432918, 69205, '<td valign="top">Recursive. Cute.</td>', 'Recursive. Cute.', '2006-11-29 22:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074088, 432100, 69205, '<td valign="top">It''s strange, I think the band on the jersey is a stronger/better diagonal than the string, which detracts from the face. There is a hint of a diagonal in the shadow, which would have been nice to have originated from the shoulder. Subject has a good strong expression.</td>', 'It''s strange, I think the band on the jersey is a stronger/better diagonal than the string, which detracts from the face. There is a hint of a diagonal in the shadow, which would have been nice to have originated from the shoulder. Subject has a good strong expression.', '2006-11-29 22:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074089, 431803, 69205, '<td valign="top">This is a nice architectural study. The person is lost in the shot and doesn''t add to it however. They are not involved with the viewer, and there is not storyline to them.</td>', 'This is a nice architectural study. The person is lost in the shot and doesn''t add to it however. They are not involved with the viewer, and there is not storyline to them.', '2006-11-29 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074090, 430836, 69205, '<td valign="top">This would have worked for me with the horizon level.</td>', 'This would have worked for me with the horizon level.', '2006-11-29 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074091, 432917, 69205, '<td valign="top">nice patterns and contrasts between them.</td>', 'nice patterns and contrasts between them.', '2006-11-29 22:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074092, 432688, 69205, '<td valign="top">nice starburst with the whiskers.</td>', 'nice starburst with the whiskers.', '2006-11-29 22:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074093, 432714, 69205, '<td valign="top">I''d suggest cropping this to exclude all of the foreground below the running figure''s shadow and then above from the top of the archways (ie, level with the vertex of the diamonds), then to also exclude all of the poles &amp; ropes to the right of the standing jacket wearer. I like the figure running from the jacketed individual to the group on the left. He is a nice action point when everyone else is standing around. Also the effect of the diagonal glass supports being reflected as <i>vertical</i> lines is well captured.</td>', 'I''d suggest cropping this to exclude all of the foreground below the running figure''s shadow and then above from the top of the archways (ie, level with the vertex of the diamonds), then to also exclude all of the poles & ropes to the right of the standing jacket wearer. I like the figure running from the jacketed individual to the group on the left. He is a nice action point when everyone else is standing around. Also the effect of the diagonal glass supports being reflected as vertical lines is well captured.', '2006-11-29 22:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074095, 432485, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice front of camera effect with the light trail.</td>', 'Nice front of camera effect with the light trail.', '2006-11-29 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074097, 431791, 60698, '<td valign="top">Lovely and moody.</td>', 'Lovely and moody.', '2006-11-29 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074098, 430891, 69205, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look cropped to the bottom left quarter (ie, with the thorax as top right, and the wings as the significant element).</td>', 'I wonder how this would look cropped to the bottom left quarter (ie, with the thorax as top right, and the wings as the significant element).', '2006-11-29 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074099, 432476, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, with simple colours. It''s a bit of a shame about all the struts in the centre though.</td>', 'Nice composition, with simple colours. It''s a bit of a shame about all the struts in the centre though.', '2006-11-29 22:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074100, 432050, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice suspense shot. They are all looking at the same spot, all waiting. Shame about the blokes, who break the repetition of form</td>', 'Nice suspense shot. They are all looking at the same spot, all waiting. Shame about the blokes, who break the repetition of form', '2006-11-29 22:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074101, 432605, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative use of diagonal and I think it works perfectly. Very nice shot.</td>', 'This is a very creative use of diagonal and I think it works perfectly. Very nice shot.', '2006-11-29 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074102, 431439, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice path, don''t like the red bollard or the steps(?). Suggest cropping almost all of the sky (below the pink clouds) out to emphasise the path.</td>', 'Nice path, don''t like the red bollard or the steps(?). Suggest cropping almost all of the sky (below the pink clouds) out to emphasise the path.', '2006-11-29 22:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074104, 432351, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice application of a standard pose.</td>', 'Nice application of a standard pose.', '2006-11-29 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074105, 432694, 66456, '<td valign="top">Your cropping really made this image.</td>', 'Your cropping really made this image.', '2006-11-29 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074106, 432709, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice, almost abstract (if it wasn''t for the steps).</td>', 'Nice, almost abstract (if it wasn''t for the steps).', '2006-11-29 22:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074107, 431003, 69205, '<td valign="top">Nice head shot, shame about the hands.</td>', 'Nice head shot, shame about the hands.', '2006-11-29 22:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
