(3074542, 431910, 67841, '<td valign="top">Although this has a strong first impression, contrast seems overdone.  It would have been more evocative to me if there were more steps of grey vs. the strong black silhouette but the composition does grow on me! I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! You''ll likely lap my submission... Good luck!</td>', 'Although this has a strong first impression, contrast seems overdone.  It would have been more evocative to me if there were more steps of grey vs. the strong black silhouette but the composition does grow on me! I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! You''ll likely lap my submission... Good luck!', '2006-11-30 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3074545, 431910, 69034, '<td valign="top">This shot is absolutely magnificent.  Ansel Adams would be jealous.</td>', 'This shot is absolutely magnificent.  Ansel Adams would be jealous.', '2006-11-30 01:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
