(3074552, 431480, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice jumper shot.  I''m glad I came back through &amp; decided to rate this higher than I had initially as it is a nice capture.</td>', 'Nice jumper shot.  I''m glad I came back through & decided to rate this higher than I had initially as it is a nice capture.', '2006-11-30 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
