(3074557, 432851, 64176, '<td valign="top">The stark white background is a little bright for my sensitive peepers.  I think an eggshell color would be lovely.  I love the shape of the leaf and the clarity.  Nice shot. 7</td>', 'The stark white background is a little bright for my sensitive peepers.  I think an eggshell color would be lovely.  I love the shape of the leaf and the clarity.  Nice shot. 7', '2006-11-30 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
