(3074596, 431409, 67841, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, but the ''diagonal'' connection seems stretched here.  Yes, I see the line of the bird from one corner to the other, but skewing the composition angle would have been compelling &amp; more in the spirit of the challenge. Focus seems a bit soft around the head, anyway.  <br/> <br/>I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! You''ll likely lap my submission... Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely capture, but the ''diagonal'' connection seems stretched here.  Yes, I see the line of the bird from one corner to the other, but skewing the composition angle would have been compelling & more in the spirit of the challenge. Focus seems a bit soft around the head, anyway.   I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! You''ll likely lap my submission... Good luck!', '2006-11-30 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
