(3074601, 431723, 67841, '<td valign="top">I''m completely missing the ''diagonal'' connection here, so I have to vote this down a bit.  Composition is nice, but I''d like to have seen more from her eyes - they''re a bit lost.  There''s nice modeling on her face &amp; would have come out more with a boost in contrast - I know that''s more a matter of personal taste, tho''.  Iit''s easy to critique to death when you''re looking for it, but I do like this shot overall! Good luck!</td>', 'I''m completely missing the ''diagonal'' connection here, so I have to vote this down a bit.  Composition is nice, but I''d like to have seen more from her eyes - they''re a bit lost.  There''s nice modeling on her face & would have come out more with a boost in contrast - I know that''s more a matter of personal taste, tho''.  Iit''s easy to critique to death when you''re looking for it, but I do like this shot overall! Good luck!', '2006-11-30 02:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
