(3074910, 431910, 69196, '<td valign="top">While this is a very nice photograph - I would have liked to see more of the fog drifting towards the front.</td>', 'While this is a very nice photograph - I would have liked to see more of the fog drifting towards the front.', '2006-11-30 08:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
