(3075436, 431795, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice picture!  Just a few quick points, the shadows on the background and extra bright spot on her right are a little distracting.  She should zip up :).  The light is a little harsh.  With all that said it is a very good shot and derserving of a high vote.</td>', 'Nice picture!  Just a few quick points, the shadows on the background and extra bright spot on her right are a little distracting.  She should zip up :).  The light is a little harsh.  With all that said it is a very good shot and derserving of a high vote.', '2006-11-30 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
