(3075711, 432718, 67694, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and lead in to the bridge. I feel I can just walk into the frame and walk across the bridge. 9</td>', 'very nice lighting and lead in to the bridge. I feel I can just walk into the frame and walk across the bridge. 9', '2006-11-30 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075715, 432637, 67694, '<td valign="top">Simple and clever... I like it!</td>', 'Simple and clever... I like it!', '2006-11-30 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075718, 432514, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong compositional sense - and that alone sets this apart in this challenge - aand good solid technicals. I can''t see that its involving enough, either on a human or a spectacular level to well here, and even allowing for the manner in which the handrail takes the eye away in a nice dynamic against the actual direction of the stairs, it lacks, for me, something more to really engage attention.</td>', 'Strong compositional sense - and that alone sets this apart in this challenge - aand good solid technicals. I can''t see that its involving enough, either on a human or a spectacular level to well here, and even allowing for the manner in which the handrail takes the eye away in a nice dynamic against the actual direction of the stairs, it lacks, for me, something more to really engage attention.', '2006-11-30 14:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075728, 431314, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s bound to be some controversy about this kind of shot: simply rotating an image to meet the challenge requirements - well, actually I don''t think it works. Your composition, regardless of the swivel, is still based on an entirely vertical/horizontal opposition. It''s a nice shot, however - good mood and sense of light. But I''d have thought it was more of an opportunity to investigate the ideas of a more complex compositional approach.</td>', 'There''s bound to be some controversy about this kind of shot: simply rotating an image to meet the challenge requirements - well, actually I don''t think it works. Your composition, regardless of the swivel, is still based on an entirely vertical/horizontal opposition. It''s a nice shot, however - good mood and sense of light. But I''d have thought it was more of an opportunity to investigate the ideas of a more complex compositional approach.', '2006-11-30 14:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075734, 432731, 66201, '<td valign="top">really bizarre effect...that''s great!</td>', 'really bizarre effect...that''s great!', '2006-11-30 14:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
