(3075846, 432390, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice capture and composition.  More height plus 640 width (if not height as well) make this even better in my opinion.  Your call (obviously), but perhaps this shot might have looked even better with a toning/something effect, especially given the difficult contrast/etc issues.</td>', '4 - Nice capture and composition.  More height plus 640 width (if not height as well) make this even better in my opinion.  Your call (obviously), but perhaps this shot might have looked even better with a toning/something effect, especially given the difficult contrast/etc issues.', '2006-11-30 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
