(3075878, 432035, 56673, '<td valign="top">The diagonal seems forced here.  I think you could have shot this without tilting the camera, and the diagonal of the glass building would have still been a very nice axis for you.  Tilting the camera just makes me tilt my head to view it.  The subject, colors, lighting are all good.</td>', 'The diagonal seems forced here.  I think you could have shot this without tilting the camera, and the diagonal of the glass building would have still been a very nice axis for you.  Tilting the camera just makes me tilt my head to view it.  The subject, colors, lighting are all good.', '2006-11-30 15:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075891, 432484, 56673, '<td valign="top">So what''s your point?  The Taliban have taken over the U.S. (where the Congress just changed hands via a fair election)?  Or Afghanistan is becoming more like the U.S. (which would be a good thing)?<br/> <br/>The image certainly works as a political statement (whether or not one agrees with it), but isn''t much of a photograph.  And the diagonal is forced, not really adding to the image.</td>', 'So what''s your point?  The Taliban have taken over the U.S. (where the Congress just changed hands via a fair election)?  Or Afghanistan is becoming more like the U.S. (which would be a good thing)? The image certainly works as a political statement (whether or not one agrees with it), but isn''t much of a photograph.  And the diagonal is forced, not really adding to the image.', '2006-11-30 15:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3075898, 432845, 56673, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but not a good quality image.  Out of focus, poor lighting, grainy.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but not a good quality image.  Out of focus, poor lighting, grainy.', '2006-11-30 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
