(3076044, 432367, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the sky - but would have like better illumination of the sign.  Too bad about the dust spot in the bottom right portion of the image - you can remove those in basic editing you know...</td>', 'I like the sky - but would have like better illumination of the sign.  Too bad about the dust spot in the bottom right portion of the image - you can remove those in basic editing you know...', '2006-11-30 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
