(3076110, 432503, 67694, '<td valign="top">diagonal lights...yes, but is the "diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust of your image". since the trees are vertical, I would have to say no -imo. still...6</td>', 'diagonal lights...yes, but is the "diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust of your image". since the trees are vertical, I would have to say no -imo. still...6', '2006-11-30 16:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
