(3076171, 432713, 67694, '<td valign="top">very very nice, my only nit-pick is that you could have used a deeper depth of field to get the bottom of the branch in sharper focus. sill good enough for a 9 in my book.</td>', 'very very nice, my only nit-pick is that you could have used a deeper depth of field to get the bottom of the branch in sharper focus. sill good enough for a 9 in my book.', '2006-11-30 17:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
