(3076293, 432454, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...just sort of odd (in a good way).  I like the colors too but mostly the characters make this a great shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Cool shot...just sort of odd (in a good way).  I like the colors too but mostly the characters make this a great shot.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2006-11-30 18:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
