(3076308, 431910, 55838, '<td valign="top">I love the simple grays &amp; blacks in this shot - a nice mix of light and darkness.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'I love the simple grays & blacks in this shot - a nice mix of light and darkness.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2006-11-30 18:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
