(3076312, 432548, 68504, '<td valign="top">Fairly excellent: rounded clouds echoed by rounded rocks which end in so fine a point just exactly before the fine land horizon, not to mention the echoing of the horizontals above and blow.</td>', 'Fairly excellent: rounded clouds echoed by rounded rocks which end in so fine a point just exactly before the fine land horizon, not to mention the echoing of the horizontals above and blow.', '2006-11-30 18:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076322, 431175, 68504, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.  Not ordinarily a fan of this sort of thing, but your use of the diagonal orientation makes me look.</td>', 'Dramatic.  Not ordinarily a fan of this sort of thing, but your use of the diagonal orientation makes me look.', '2006-11-30 18:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076323, 430742, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. The lighting, focus, color and POV are all top notch. I''m just not sure about her cleavage line with the way it enters the frame but it does appear to strengthed the diagonal composition. However you already have a good diagonal going so I think a tighter crop from the bottom would have worked better or perhaps adding a soft vignette to diffuse the shadow from the clevage. Anyway, just a thought.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. The lighting, focus, color and POV are all top notch. I''m just not sure about her cleavage line with the way it enters the frame but it does appear to strengthed the diagonal composition. However you already have a good diagonal going so I think a tighter crop from the bottom would have worked better or perhaps adding a soft vignette to diffuse the shadow from the clevage. Anyway, just a thought.', '2006-11-30 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076324, 432081, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely divine.  I can''t think of a single thing I would change.  Perfect.  Which brings me to my vote...a rare 10 from me.  (It''s not that I''m a troll by any means but hey...you gotta save your 10''s for the best of the best and this is it!).  Wonderful job and my pick for blue.</td>', 'This is absolutely divine.  I can''t think of a single thing I would change.  Perfect.  Which brings me to my vote...a rare 10 from me.  (It''s not that I''m a troll by any means but hey...you gotta save your 10''s for the best of the best and this is it!).  Wonderful job and my pick for blue.', '2006-11-30 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076331, 432709, 68504, '<td valign="top">Well (!), you made me really look.  That has to be worth something.</td>', 'Well (!), you made me really look.  That has to be worth something.', '2006-11-30 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076339, 432706, 68504, '<td valign="top">Like the layout and lights in the composition. I do, however, keep looking for obscured details and don"t know if that"s a plus or minus.</td>', 'Like the layout and lights in the composition. I do, however, keep looking for obscured details and don"t know if that"s a plus or minus.', '2006-11-30 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
