(3076491, 431356, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is exactly what I took the challenge to mean - "A diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust" - IMO, you''ve successfully achieved this. Love the angle and perspective. An interesting, well shot and strong composition. Polished off with a great cinematic border too!. 10</td>', 'Yes, this is exactly what I took the challenge to mean - "A diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust" - IMO, you''ve successfully achieved this. Love the angle and perspective. An interesting, well shot and strong composition. Polished off with a great cinematic border too!. 10', '2006-11-30 19:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
