(3076574, 432615, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is such an intriguing vision. Took me a while to realise that it''s been sliced into 3. Not sure if the editing is legal in Basic, but since you could have very easily accomplished this using a broken mirror, I''m happy to give the benefit of the doubt here. Great low key image, 8.</td>', 'This is such an intriguing vision. Took me a while to realise that it''s been sliced into 3. Not sure if the editing is legal in Basic, but since you could have very easily accomplished this using a broken mirror, I''m happy to give the benefit of the doubt here. Great low key image, 8.', '2006-11-30 20:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076631, 432900, 35352, '<td valign="top">Unlike all the other photographers who met the diagonal challenge simply by rotating their camera, your photo actually works. I love it. The lighting is perfect, the focus is perfect, the beauty of the girl isn''t obscured at all.</td>', 'Unlike all the other photographers who met the diagonal challenge simply by rotating their camera, your photo actually works. I love it. The lighting is perfect, the focus is perfect, the beauty of the girl isn''t obscured at all.', '2006-11-30 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
