(3078073, 432639, 67324, '<td valign="top">That girls face is freaky in this shot. Had to say it. Interesting enough, not a huge ''Diagonal thrust...'' 6</td>', 'That girls face is freaky in this shot. Had to say it. Interesting enough, not a huge ''Diagonal thrust...'' 6', '2006-12-01 06:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
