(3078083, 431833, 67324, '<td valign="top">The other Diagon Alley was better, they called theirs Diagonal Alley and was seedier. This would sit much better in a tourist book and is better photographed.</td>', 'The other Diagon Alley was better, they called theirs Diagonal Alley and was seedier. This would sit much better in a tourist book and is better photographed.', '2006-12-01 06:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
