(3079225, 430838, 17507, '<td valign="top">hrm. a signet is a personal seal used to show authenticity of a document. a cygnet is a young swan. i suspect you mean the latter, unless you plan to dip this bird in wax and stamp it on a document ;]</td>', 'hrm. a signet is a personal seal used to show authenticity of a document. a cygnet is a young swan. i suspect you mean the latter, unless you plan to dip this bird in wax and stamp it on a document ;]', '2006-12-01 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079226, 432723, 68256, '<td valign="top">See now there is a well done rotation of camera to cause diagonals...Good job and very interesting.</td>', 'See now there is a well done rotation of camera to cause diagonals...Good job and very interesting.', '2006-12-01 13:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079230, 432653, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks (a) like something bear_music would do - great tonality of light - and (b) like quite a project!</td>', 'looks (a) like something bear_music would do - great tonality of light - and (b) like quite a project!', '2006-12-01 13:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079231, 432845, 17507, '<td valign="top">hahah... i''m tempted to make some joke about new orleans and katrina, but it would be in poor taste</td>', 'hahah... i''m tempted to make some joke about new orleans and katrina, but it would be in poor taste', '2006-12-01 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079236, 432310, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Diagonals without me having to twist my head..thanks.  Your exposure on this is perfect (at least on my monitor).</td>', 'Very nice!  Diagonals without me having to twist my head..thanks.  Your exposure on this is perfect (at least on my monitor).', '2006-12-01 13:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079238, 431071, 17507, '<td valign="top">best of the dozens of bird shots i''ve seen so far... great angle, exposure, and focus. the diagonal is a strong element of this image and it does not seem arbitrary.</td>', 'best of the dozens of bird shots i''ve seen so far... great angle, exposure, and focus. the diagonal is a strong element of this image and it does not seem arbitrary.', '2006-12-01 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079239, 432763, 17507, '<td valign="top">call me freudian, but i see strong male/female symbolism here - the icicles are arguably phallic, and the curves in the background are unmistakably feminine.</td>', 'call me freudian, but i see strong male/female symbolism here - the icicles are arguably phallic, and the curves in the background are unmistakably feminine.', '2006-12-01 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079241, 431138, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh lighting and shadows.  Maybe if the background was a little cleaner and the wheat? at the top left wasn''t there it would have more impact ON ME.  Overall though I think you did a fantastic job.</td>', 'I like the harsh lighting and shadows.  Maybe if the background was a little cleaner and the wheat? at the top left wasn''t there it would have more impact ON ME.  Overall though I think you did a fantastic job.', '2006-12-01 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079247, 432688, 68256, '<td valign="top">When ugly meets cute?  Good composition and incorporation of diagonals.  Well done.</td>', 'When ugly meets cute?  Good composition and incorporation of diagonals.  Well done.', '2006-12-01 13:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079264, 431831, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think I would have cropped off the stuff at the top, it''s too heavy looking. But the rest of it is beautifully composed.</td>', 'Nice. I think I would have cropped off the stuff at the top, it''s too heavy looking. But the rest of it is beautifully composed.', '2006-12-01 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079276, 431347, 66952, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, nice colors. I think it might be a bit oversharpened. I can see the halo along the horizon line.</td>', 'Interesting composition, nice colors. I think it might be a bit oversharpened. I can see the halo along the horizon line.', '2006-12-01 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079284, 432575, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Very subtle.</td>', 'Beautiful! Very subtle.', '2006-12-01 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079353, 432575, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Such wonderful lighting and tone!  Personally I don''t like the sloping angle, I keep wanting to tilt my head.  I think the diagonals would have been there either way right?  So I''m giving it a 9.  Just one other thought and I know this probably sounds crazy, but it would have been neat if the 3rd pair of sandels was in equal light.</td>', 'Wow!  Such wonderful lighting and tone!  Personally I don''t like the sloping angle, I keep wanting to tilt my head.  I think the diagonals would have been there either way right?  So I''m giving it a 9.  Just one other thought and I know this probably sounds crazy, but it would have been neat if the 3rd pair of sandels was in equal light.', '2006-12-01 14:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079365, 432867, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  Thanks for not tilting your camera!</td>', 'Very nice colors!  Thanks for not tilting your camera!', '2006-12-01 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079400, 432840, 61493, '<td valign="top">Am I seeing things or are these miniatures?  So cool</td>', 'Am I seeing things or are these miniatures?  So cool', '2006-12-01 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079403, 431633, 61493, '<td valign="top">Too small, but a good photo</td>', 'Too small, but a good photo', '2006-12-01 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079404, 432794, 61493, '<td valign="top">What kind of a lens did you use for this shot, you must teach me.  Way cool.</td>', 'What kind of a lens did you use for this shot, you must teach me.  Way cool.', '2006-12-01 14:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079410, 432740, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think if there were some sort of stark diagonal composition in this,, it would be a far more interesting picture. As it is, it''s text-book rule of thirds. Good picture, by all means, but it doesn''t get off the ground in the challenge context imo 5</td>', 'I think if there were some sort of stark diagonal composition in this,, it would be a far more interesting picture. As it is, it''s text-book rule of thirds. Good picture, by all means, but it doesn''t get off the ground in the challenge context imo 5', '2006-12-01 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079412, 431855, 57229, '<td valign="top">Very graphic, nice - 7</td>', 'Very graphic, nice - 7', '2006-12-01 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079417, 432344, 57229, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, but I''m having trouble seeing the "diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust of your image", or much else, I suppose . . .</td>', 'Love the picture, but I''m having trouble seeing the "diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust of your image", or much else, I suppose . . .', '2006-12-01 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
