(3080673, 432584, 31341, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the lighting is very subject unfriendly.  The curtain in the back is too bright almost making it the subject.  If you had put it on a continuous sheet of white paper and lit it from the lower left, the shadows could have created your diagonals, and the subject would have been lit.  This can all be done with the window lighting.  You don''t need artificial.</td>', 'Good idea, but the lighting is very subject unfriendly.  The curtain in the back is too bright almost making it the subject.  If you had put it on a continuous sheet of white paper and lit it from the lower left, the shadows could have created your diagonals, and the subject would have been lit.  This can all be done with the window lighting.  You don''t need artificial.', '2006-12-01 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
