(3080720, 431723, 31341, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.  On my monitor it is a tad over sharpened especially in the eyelashes of the right eye.  Maybe because I have been looking at so many exaggerated diagonals, there is not enough in this.  The bridge of the nose, which is the lightest portion of the face, is vertical.  A slight tilt either way to get it diagonal might make the whole thing pop. If this was cropped out of a larger, there might be room to try it.  Great expression on the model!  (Still give it a 6, which is high for me.)</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.  On my monitor it is a tad over sharpened especially in the eyelashes of the right eye.  Maybe because I have been looking at so many exaggerated diagonals, there is not enough in this.  The bridge of the nose, which is the lightest portion of the face, is vertical.  A slight tilt either way to get it diagonal might make the whole thing pop. If this was cropped out of a larger, there might be room to try it.  Great expression on the model!  (Still give it a 6, which is high for me.)', '2006-12-01 22:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
