(3083229, 431054, 53147, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and just a great capture overall. Very nice that you caught the wings where you did rather than one with wings right at the side . This is just excellent. Bumping up 1 for now. Would love to see this in ribbon territory.5</td>', 'Lovely image and just a great capture overall. Very nice that you caught the wings where you did rather than one with wings right at the side . This is just excellent. Bumping up 1 for now. Would love to see this in ribbon territory.5', '2006-12-03 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083264, 431750, 67841, '<td valign="top">I love the colors &amp; silhouettes in this piece, but "diagonal" seems to have been interpreted loosely - yes, I see the dock but it doesn''t play a large enough role in the composition for me to see it weigh heavily as an angle factor.  I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY work is any beter!</td>', 'I love the colors & silhouettes in this piece, but "diagonal" seems to have been interpreted loosely - yes, I see the dock but it doesn''t play a large enough role in the composition for me to see it weigh heavily as an angle factor.  I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY work is any beter!', '2006-12-03 10:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083268, 432267, 67841, '<td valign="top">Although the rainbow makes for an interesting start here, everything else seems a bit lacking &amp; overall I''m left sort of disinterested.  Framing is such that it seems like the horizon might be off &amp; I can''t help but wonder if there isn''t more interesting stuff on top of the hill. This may have had better impact if it had been framed landscape instead of portrait? I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! Good luck!</td>', 'Although the rainbow makes for an interesting start here, everything else seems a bit lacking & overall I''m left sort of disinterested.  Framing is such that it seems like the horizon might be off & I can''t help but wonder if there isn''t more interesting stuff on top of the hill. This may have had better impact if it had been framed landscape instead of portrait? I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! Good luck!', '2006-12-03 10:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083270, 432918, 67841, '<td valign="top">This ties in well with the challenge, but I''m missing the ''wow'' factor.  Perhaps slightly deeper DOF (I sorta feel the spine should be in focus as well)  &amp; creative lighting would have brought more to the party.  I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! Good luck!</td>', 'This ties in well with the challenge, but I''m missing the ''wow'' factor.  Perhaps slightly deeper DOF (I sorta feel the spine should be in focus as well)  & creative lighting would have brought more to the party.  I''m pretty much a newbie here, though, so take my comments with a grain of salt - just ''cause I''m being critical doesn''t mean I think MY stuff is doing any better! Good luck!', '2006-12-03 10:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
