(3083413, 432898, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract. Like the colors. I think the graininess detracts a bit, however.</td>', 'An interesting abstract. Like the colors. I think the graininess detracts a bit, however.', '2006-12-03 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083417, 432575, 66597, '<td valign="top">The diagonal shadows are flattering and add interest. The composition could be a bit stronger if Buddha''s head were not at very top of photo, perhaps.</td>', 'The diagonal shadows are flattering and add interest. The composition could be a bit stronger if Buddha''s head were not at very top of photo, perhaps.', '2006-12-03 11:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083418, 431522, 67841, '<td valign="top">Though the motion blur might kill you during voting, I really like the overall impression of this one.</td>', 'Though the motion blur might kill you during voting, I really like the overall impression of this one.', '2006-12-03 11:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083421, 432698, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the long DOF you used. Makes it unusual. I''m not sure about the extreme saturation you put into the dock, however. Still, overall I''m grooving on this photo. 7.</td>', 'I like the long DOF you used. Makes it unusual. I''m not sure about the extreme saturation you put into the dock, however. Still, overall I''m grooving on this photo. 7.', '2006-12-03 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083423, 432846, 66597, '<td valign="top">Never thought I''d see a banker''s lamp look interesting, but you pulled it off.</td>', 'Never thought I''d see a banker''s lamp look interesting, but you pulled it off.', '2006-12-03 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083428, 430838, 66597, '<td valign="top">Something about the crop / composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think I''d like to see a bit more at the bottom. Beautiful focus and lighting, though. 6.</td>', 'Something about the crop / composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think I''d like to see a bit more at the bottom. Beautiful focus and lighting, though. 6.', '2006-12-03 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083430, 432764, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wish he were just a bit sharper. Good capture.</td>', 'Wish he were just a bit sharper. Good capture.', '2006-12-03 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083432, 432327, 67841, '<td valign="top">Great initial impression - very nice composition, exposure &amp; tones - well executed - all those angles povide some ''wow'' factor, but I''d still need more before voting higher than 8.</td>', 'Great initial impression - very nice composition, exposure & tones - well executed - all those angles povide some ''wow'' factor, but I''d still need more before voting higher than 8.', '2006-12-03 12:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083433, 432516, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the perspective and the colors just pop.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the perspective and the colors just pop.', '2006-12-03 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083436, 432346, 66597, '<td valign="top">My eyes are wandering this photo looking for just a small, sharply focused area on which to focus as subject, perhaps where the two branches join toward top right.</td>', 'My eyes are wandering this photo looking for just a small, sharply focused area on which to focus as subject, perhaps where the two branches join toward top right.', '2006-12-03 12:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083437, 432885, 67841, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract - came back to bump you to 10 - can''t wait to find out what it was so you better tell!</td>', 'Lovely abstract - came back to bump you to 10 - can''t wait to find out what it was so you better tell!', '2006-12-03 12:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083439, 430866, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOVE it! Did you use a tungsten filter on this, or is bird naturally so blue? I hope this ribbons. In my eye, perfect composition.</td>', 'LOVE it! Did you use a tungsten filter on this, or is bird naturally so blue? I hope this ribbons. In my eye, perfect composition.', '2006-12-03 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083440, 432849, 66597, '<td valign="top">Creative. Wish the cherry were a tad sharper.</td>', 'Creative. Wish the cherry were a tad sharper.', '2006-12-03 12:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083442, 431910, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks like a sumi-e Japanese ink painting. Really lovely in its simplicity.</td>', 'This looks like a sumi-e Japanese ink painting. Really lovely in its simplicity.', '2006-12-03 12:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083443, 432747, 67841, '<td valign="top">Great title &amp; composition - gave me a laugh so you get my only 9...</td>', 'Great title & composition - gave me a laugh so you get my only 9...', '2006-12-03 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083444, 432514, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the spiral look of these stairs. The lighting could be a bit stronger IMO-.</td>', 'I really like the spiral look of these stairs. The lighting could be a bit stronger IMO-.', '2006-12-03 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083447, 432497, 67841, '<td valign="top">I''m sure some are nailing you for the flaws in the glass but I still love this one - good luck!</td>', 'I''m sure some are nailing you for the flaws in the glass but I still love this one - good luck!', '2006-12-03 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083448, 431322, 66597, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a bit too much going on in this photo? I do like the lighting and small palette of colors.</td>', 'Maybe just a bit too much going on in this photo? I do like the lighting and small palette of colors.', '2006-12-03 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083449, 432710, 66597, '<td valign="top">Where is this? Exotic and insteresting. Makes you want to open up the shutters and see what''s inside.</td>', 'Where is this? Exotic and insteresting. Makes you want to open up the shutters and see what''s inside.', '2006-12-03 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083450, 432484, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL - who would ever think something like this up? You, obviously. Very creative.</td>', 'LOL - who would ever think something like this up? You, obviously. Very creative.', '2006-12-03 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083451, 432353, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks just a tad overexposed to me, or maybe not quite enough saturation.</td>', 'Looks just a tad overexposed to me, or maybe not quite enough saturation.', '2006-12-03 12:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083454, 431178, 66597, '<td valign="top">Angle of plane is cool (taken at Air &amp; Space Museum near DC, I presume?). The white light at bottom unfortunately draws eye away from subject.</td>', 'Angle of plane is cool (taken at Air & Space Museum near DC, I presume?). The white light at bottom unfortunately draws eye away from subject.', '2006-12-03 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083455, 432745, 66597, '<td valign="top">Whites look too blown out to focus on subject in front right.</td>', 'Whites look too blown out to focus on subject in front right.', '2006-12-03 12:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083458, 432756, 66597, '<td valign="top">Like the creativity. Wishing for just a bit more contrast between fence and sky in areas other than sunburst, and a tighter crop might help focal point pop a bit more.</td>', 'Like the creativity. Wishing for just a bit more contrast between fence and sky in areas other than sunburst, and a tighter crop might help focal point pop a bit more.', '2006-12-03 12:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083459, 431164, 66597, '<td valign="top">Like how the subject is out of focus. Works very well here.</td>', 'Like how the subject is out of focus. Works very well here.', '2006-12-03 12:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083461, 432155, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wish spider were just a tad sharper. Nice bokeh!</td>', 'Wish spider were just a tad sharper. Nice bokeh!', '2006-12-03 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083462, 431356, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. Love the long DOF in this.</td>', 'Very cool perspective. Love the long DOF in this.', '2006-12-03 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083463, 432817, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks too saturated, but the angles are nice.</td>', 'Looks too saturated, but the angles are nice.', '2006-12-03 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083465, 431138, 66597, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is just sublime. Absolute 10. The shadow in the top left is especially captivating, but the whole (difficult) composition works beautifully together.</td>', 'Oh, this is just sublime. Absolute 10. The shadow in the top left is especially captivating, but the whole (difficult) composition works beautifully together.', '2006-12-03 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083466, 432722, 66597, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a bit more of the whites on the church, but love the angle.</td>', 'Would like to see a bit more of the whites on the church, but love the angle.', '2006-12-03 12:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083467, 432780, 66597, '<td valign="top">Industrial fruit! This one is out of the box, that''s for sure. I really like it, blue lights and all.</td>', 'Industrial fruit! This one is out of the box, that''s for sure. I really like it, blue lights and all.', '2006-12-03 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083468, 432811, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think a straight horizon would really help this photo. The line of the wharf would make a more pleasing diagonal.</td>', 'I think a straight horizon would really help this photo. The line of the wharf would make a more pleasing diagonal.', '2006-12-03 12:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083469, 432213, 66597, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Hope you had a really good telephoto for this one... Great capture.</td>', 'Yikes! Hope you had a really good telephoto for this one... Great capture.', '2006-12-03 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083470, 432762, 66597, '<td valign="top">You''re making me hungry. The bee too, evidently. Great capture.</td>', 'You''re making me hungry. The bee too, evidently. Great capture.', '2006-12-03 12:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083471, 432822, 66597, '<td valign="top">If the birds were a bit sharper, this would be very strong, I think. Great colors in background.</td>', 'If the birds were a bit sharper, this would be very strong, I think. Great colors in background.', '2006-12-03 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083472, 431540, 66597, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful cat! Makes me want to pet him...bad idea. Lovely capture with nice yellow in background and perfect exposure.</td>', 'What a beautiful cat! Makes me want to pet him...bad idea. Lovely capture with nice yellow in background and perfect exposure.', '2006-12-03 12:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083473, 430763, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had to crop too tightly to keep enough focus. Nice lines, though.</td>', 'Looks like you had to crop too tightly to keep enough focus. Nice lines, though.', '2006-12-03 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083477, 432783, 66597, '<td valign="top">If this were a bit sharper it would be very strong.</td>', 'If this were a bit sharper it would be very strong.', '2006-12-03 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083482, 432852, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wish there were a highlight on the road</td>', 'Wish there were a highlight on the road', '2006-12-03 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083600, 432605, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, the diagonal nature of the framing is perfect. 9.</td>', 'I like this very much, the diagonal nature of the framing is perfect. 9.', '2006-12-03 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083659, 430877, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a moment - superbly captured!</td>', 'What a moment - superbly captured!', '2006-12-03 14:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083660, 432653, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very inventive!  Are those centimetres?  They have to be.  He, he, I like it that the pattern doesn''t have seam allowances included, I never liked patterns with seam allowances.  About the photo, it has a beautiful diagonal feel to it.  It is a bit strange, and I''m not quite sure what the point of it is except humour, but I like it.  ~8</td>', 'Very inventive!  Are those centimetres?  They have to be.  He, he, I like it that the pattern doesn''t have seam allowances included, I never liked patterns with seam allowances.  About the photo, it has a beautiful diagonal feel to it.  It is a bit strange, and I''m not quite sure what the point of it is except humour, but I like it.  ~8', '2006-12-03 14:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083661, 432773, 5112, '<td valign="top">Crisscross diagonals, nice pattern of wood and holes and shadows.  Nice study.  ~6</td>', 'Crisscross diagonals, nice pattern of wood and holes and shadows.  Nice study.  ~6', '2006-12-03 14:31:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3083663, 432680, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful entry, very much diagonal in feel.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Beautiful entry, very much diagonal in feel.  One of my favourites.', '2006-12-03 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083665, 431071, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good entry, I like the tail feathers in particular, they let the light shine through.  I sort of wish the wing tips were not cut off.  ~8</td>', 'Good entry, I like the tail feathers in particular, they let the light shine through.  I sort of wish the wing tips were not cut off.  ~8', '2006-12-03 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083668, 430847, 5112, '<td valign="top">It definitely has a diagonal feel, and it''s a good idea for the challenge, and a good idea for a photo.  The treatment, IMHO, doesn''t do the image justice, it makes it look fakey where it could be such a strong image in B/W.  ~6</td>', 'It definitely has a diagonal feel, and it''s a good idea for the challenge, and a good idea for a photo.  The treatment, IMHO, doesn''t do the image justice, it makes it look fakey where it could be such a strong image in B/W.  ~6', '2006-12-03 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083673, 431536, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice  natural diagonal, the colours in the sky are pretty.  Is this HDR or tone-mapped?  ~6</td>', 'Nice  natural diagonal, the colours in the sky are pretty.  Is this HDR or tone-mapped?  ~6', '2006-12-03 14:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083684, 431831, 3746, '<td valign="top">thumbnail doesnt do this shot justice.. well done.. 8</td>', 'thumbnail doesnt do this shot justice.. well done.. 8', '2006-12-03 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083685, 431686, 5112, '<td valign="top">The mountain scene is beautiful, but I''m not sure that including the railing (is it a railing?) makes this a "diagonal" image.  It doesn''t feel diagonal, even with that line there.  ~5</td>', 'The mountain scene is beautiful, but I''m not sure that including the railing (is it a railing?) makes this a "diagonal" image.  It doesn''t feel diagonal, even with that line there.  ~5', '2006-12-03 14:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083687, 432755, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good abstract, beautiful colours, nice line.  ~7</td>', 'Good abstract, beautiful colours, nice line.  ~7', '2006-12-03 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083688, 432528, 3746, '<td valign="top">Wow, you nailed the focus on this shot (you can see the shallow DOF you had to play with by looking at the fence.. good solid image.. 8</td>', 'Wow, you nailed the focus on this shot (you can see the shallow DOF you had to play with by looking at the fence.. good solid image.. 8', '2006-12-03 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083691, 432584, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is good here, the reflection in the glass of wine is intriguing.  I am not sure what the apple has to do with the wine, and the picture doesn''t make it clear.  I think, for the image to work better, it would be best to not have such a busy background (both the tablecloth and the courtain), it''s too much to absorb, and it really takes away from the best part of the image, which is the reflection in the glass of wine.  ~6</td>', 'I think the idea is good here, the reflection in the glass of wine is intriguing.  I am not sure what the apple has to do with the wine, and the picture doesn''t make it clear.  I think, for the image to work better, it would be best to not have such a busy background (both the tablecloth and the courtain), it''s too much to absorb, and it really takes away from the best part of the image, which is the reflection in the glass of wine.  ~6', '2006-12-03 14:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083712, 432326, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ah, good entry, diagonals without resorting to a tilt of the horizon line.  Good colours, very November like.  ~7</td>', 'Ah, good entry, diagonals without resorting to a tilt of the horizon line.  Good colours, very November like.  ~7', '2006-12-03 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083714, 431054, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, this is my favourite (so far) in the challenge.. perfect shot, sticks to the challenge nicely. welldone.<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'OK, this is my favourite (so far) in the challenge.. perfect shot, sticks to the challenge nicely. welldone. 10', '2006-12-03 14:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083718, 431910, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good natural diagonals.  What a steep hillside!  Difficult to control the light in this situation.  Looks good in B/W.  ~8</td>', 'Very good natural diagonals.  What a steep hillside!  Difficult to control the light in this situation.  Looks good in B/W.  ~8', '2006-12-03 14:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083721, 432351, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good entry, nice picture of the dog.  I like the natural diagonal.  ~7</td>', 'Good entry, nice picture of the dog.  I like the natural diagonal.  ~7', '2006-12-03 14:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083737, 430742, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good natural diagonal lines.  Beautiful image.  The lock of hair at the left is a bit distracting, in the sense that when I first looked at the image, it looked like a shadow (it is quite similar to her cleavage shadow), and I thought there was a hand or something on her shoulder.  Her smile is just beautiful!  ~9</td>', 'Very good natural diagonal lines.  Beautiful image.  The lock of hair at the left is a bit distracting, in the sense that when I first looked at the image, it looked like a shadow (it is quite similar to her cleavage shadow), and I thought there was a hand or something on her shoulder.  Her smile is just beautiful!  ~9', '2006-12-03 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083739, 432861, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like it, very graphic.  ~9</td>', 'I like it, very graphic.  ~9', '2006-12-03 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083743, 432240, 56000, '<td valign="top">nice DOF and you really caught the emotion of the model.</td>', 'nice DOF and you really caught the emotion of the model.', '2006-12-03 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083744, 432723, 5112, '<td valign="top">One of the few images in the challenge where the artificial diagonal (the tilted horizon line) actually works quite well.  Good entry.  I love  how the silhouetted figure is walking into the foggy light, big shadow behind. The picture has a good feel.  ~9</td>', 'One of the few images in the challenge where the artificial diagonal (the tilted horizon line) actually works quite well.  Good entry.  I love  how the silhouetted figure is walking into the foggy light, big shadow behind. The picture has a good feel.  ~9', '2006-12-03 14:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083750, 431186, 56000, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this photo would look like if you crop without the sky?  There''s enough texture in the wood to know that it''s wood.  Taken at a great time of the day.  NIce color.</td>', 'I wonder what this photo would look like if you crop without the sky?  There''s enough texture in the wood to know that it''s wood.  Taken at a great time of the day.  NIce color.', '2006-12-03 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083755, 432520, 56000, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but still a lot of horizontal.</td>', 'nice photo, but still a lot of horizontal.', '2006-12-03 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083757, 432849, 56000, '<td valign="top">looks out of focus.</td>', 'looks out of focus.', '2006-12-03 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083760, 432456, 5112, '<td valign="top">One of the most beautiful entries to diagonals IMO.  I love this one!  And the artificially tilted horizon line actually works well (few of the entries that do that work).  I hope you do well.  ~10</td>', 'One of the most beautiful entries to diagonals IMO.  I love this one!  And the artificially tilted horizon line actually works well (few of the entries that do that work).  I hope you do well.  ~10', '2006-12-03 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083761, 432203, 32872, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2006-12-03 15:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083768, 432037, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sweet.</td>', 'Sweet.', '2006-12-03 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083771, 432731, 56000, '<td valign="top">i bet this looks even better on the horizontal.  nice colors.</td>', 'i bet this looks even better on the horizontal.  nice colors.', '2006-12-03 15:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083772, 432283, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great diagonals!   As much as I love blur, in this case I wish the figure were frozen perfectly clear in mid air :)  ~8</td>', 'Great diagonals!   As much as I love blur, in this case I wish the figure were frozen perfectly clear in mid air :)  ~8', '2006-12-03 15:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083778, 432857, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Great diagonal feel.  Almost abstract, yet very, very concrete in a way.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Great diagonal feel.  Almost abstract, yet very, very concrete in a way.  ~9', '2006-12-03 15:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083783, 430633, 32872, '<td valign="top">Great colors, detail and what an insect, huh?  Nice!!</td>', 'Great colors, detail and what an insect, huh?  Nice!!', '2006-12-03 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083784, 431633, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot from below, the sky is fantastic.  It is a bit funny in a way, because the sky does have a very diagonal feel, but the subject doesn''t.  I imagine many others will tell you this, but it would be good if you entered larger images (640 px on the longest side).  ~5</td>', 'Good shot from below, the sky is fantastic.  It is a bit funny in a way, because the sky does have a very diagonal feel, but the subject doesn''t.  I imagine many others will tell you this, but it would be good if you entered larger images (640 px on the longest side).  ~5', '2006-12-03 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083787, 432637, 56000, '<td valign="top">IMHO, the focus should be on the 3rd bottle from either end.  This would lead the eye to the focus point a bit, rather than bringing the eye backwards (feels funny).  Nice idea and great lighting.</td>', 'IMHO, the focus should be on the 3rd bottle from either end.  This would lead the eye to the focus point a bit, rather than bringing the eye backwards (feels funny).  Nice idea and great lighting.', '2006-12-03 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083788, 432343, 5112, '<td valign="top">Not strong diagonals, but very much a feel of diagonal.  Lovely entry.  I like the light on the sails.  I also like all the little people, especially those with their legs hanging over the edge.  ~8</td>', 'Not strong diagonals, but very much a feel of diagonal.  Lovely entry.  I like the light on the sails.  I also like all the little people, especially those with their legs hanging over the edge.  ~8', '2006-12-03 15:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083793, 430720, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image of a humming bird.  I love your great caprure!</td>', 'Beautiful image of a humming bird.  I love your great caprure!', '2006-12-03 15:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083794, 432511, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well, making pictures like this you shouldn''t be out of work.  This is quite beautiful, even though it looks sort of surreal.  Good diagonal feel to the image, even with the straight horizon.  ~8</td>', 'Well, making pictures like this you shouldn''t be out of work.  This is quite beautiful, even though it looks sort of surreal.  Good diagonal feel to the image, even with the straight horizon.  ~8', '2006-12-03 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083795, 432798, 56000, '<td valign="top">photo seems very noisy.  Was it with high iso?  Also, the sun flare by the leaf is a little distracting</td>', 'photo seems very noisy.  Was it with high iso?  Also, the sun flare by the leaf is a little distracting', '2006-12-03 15:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083804, 432240, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent diagonal feel to the image, without resorting to artifices.  She looks more angry than cold (or really ticked off at something).  The toning is beautiful.  ~8</td>', 'Excellent diagonal feel to the image, without resorting to artifices.  She looks more angry than cold (or really ticked off at something).  The toning is beautiful.  ~8', '2006-12-03 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083805, 432571, 56000, '<td valign="top">great lighting, pose, and model!</td>', 'great lighting, pose, and model!', '2006-12-03 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083808, 430877, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is just the funniest entry!  Love it.  It doesn''t have a terribly strong diagonal feel to it, my eyes are wandering more across the image than at a diagonal, but it is a fantastic photo!  ~9</td>', 'This is just the funniest entry!  Love it.  It doesn''t have a terribly strong diagonal feel to it, my eyes are wandering more across the image than at a diagonal, but it is a fantastic photo!  ~9', '2006-12-03 15:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083810, 431638, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great natural diagonal!  Lovely colours.  ~9</td>', 'Great natural diagonal!  Lovely colours.  ~9', '2006-12-03 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
