(3088075, 432857, 69008, '<td valign="top">Stillness, motion and natural beauty. Water, sky, and a hint of wooded shore. I don''t see how this could get any better. I still reserve the 10 for a pic that I have yet to see, but this is close.</td>', 'Stillness, motion and natural beauty. Water, sky, and a hint of wooded shore. I don''t see how this could get any better. I still reserve the 10 for a pic that I have yet to see, but this is close.', '2006-12-05 01:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088076, 432774, 69008, '<td valign="top">Most of us love babies. I had to think for a while about this one, and though I didn''t come to any big conclusion about it, I like it, and it''s well lighted. The mystery about what to think of it seems to make it work for me. I''m thinking 7.5 so will round it to 8.  Good entry. Thanks.</td>', 'Most of us love babies. I had to think for a while about this one, and though I didn''t come to any big conclusion about it, I like it, and it''s well lighted. The mystery about what to think of it seems to make it work for me. I''m thinking 7.5 so will round it to 8.  Good entry. Thanks.', '2006-12-05 01:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088078, 430838, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo of a beautiful bird with a name! The foot adds to the effect.</td>', 'Very sharp photo of a beautiful bird with a name! The foot adds to the effect.', '2006-12-05 01:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088079, 432900, 69008, '<td valign="top">No frills, right to the point. Captivating gaze. The tilt helps it work too.</td>', 'No frills, right to the point. Captivating gaze. The tilt helps it work too.', '2006-12-05 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088080, 432485, 69008, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, and very "artsy" and a game that''s about universal.  The light drag at the bottom takes something away from the thrust of the light slash, so 8. Without the light drag, I would be a 9.  A sparkler moving at the right  steady speed would add excitement to the slash. Captivating image, no frills, good colors.</td>', 'Cool concept, and very "artsy" and a game that''s about universal.  The light drag at the bottom takes something away from the thrust of the light slash, so 8. Without the light drag, I would be a 9.  A sparkler moving at the right  steady speed would add excitement to the slash. Captivating image, no frills, good colors.', '2006-12-05 01:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088081, 431347, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Relaxing color and lines. Enough detail for study, but not overwhelming. On target for the challenge parameters. Good choice of slow shutter speed. Almost made 9.</td>', 'Very nice, Relaxing color and lines. Enough detail for study, but not overwhelming. On target for the challenge parameters. Good choice of slow shutter speed. Almost made 9.', '2006-12-05 01:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088082, 431175, 69008, '<td valign="top">Complex, but great use of the subject, and perspective. The diagonal shot works better than a level one. Fits the challenge, and that gets it an extra point.</td>', 'Complex, but great use of the subject, and perspective. The diagonal shot works better than a level one. Fits the challenge, and that gets it an extra point.', '2006-12-05 01:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088083, 432728, 69008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location, and perfect reflections in the water. The time of day/light color quality, and exposure are right on as well. The tower is sort of plus and minus, as it adds depth and clutter at the same time. It''s a 7.5 so 8 it is.</td>', 'Beautiful location, and perfect reflections in the water. The time of day/light color quality, and exposure are right on as well. The tower is sort of plus and minus, as it adds depth and clutter at the same time. It''s a 7.5 so 8 it is.', '2006-12-05 01:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088084, 432917, 69008, '<td valign="top">Powerful graphic. Can''t help but think "Amber."</td>', 'Powerful graphic. Can''t help but think "Amber."', '2006-12-05 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088086, 431154, 69008, '<td valign="top">good timing, saw it coming and waited for the right moment to arrive</td>', 'good timing, saw it coming and waited for the right moment to arrive', '2006-12-05 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088087, 431403, 69008, '<td valign="top">Poof! You are now a "Times" photographer. It fits the contest theme well.</td>', 'Poof! You are now a "Times" photographer. It fits the contest theme well.', '2006-12-05 01:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
