(3088089, 432718, 69008, '<td valign="top">Night makes it work. Too bad the tops of the towers were so brightly lit. Still it''s relaxing to look at.</td>', 'Night makes it work. Too bad the tops of the towers were so brightly lit. Still it''s relaxing to look at.', '2006-12-05 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
