(3088091, 432156, 69008, '<td valign="top">Classy, but tough on my eyes. Autofocus would have a bad time with this scene. It doesn''t get much more diagonal than this, so a 7 for hitting the challenge criteria squarely. B&amp;W works good for this one too.</td>', 'Classy, but tough on my eyes. Autofocus would have a bad time with this scene. It doesn''t get much more diagonal than this, so a 7 for hitting the challenge criteria squarely. B&W works good for this one too.', '2006-12-05 01:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
