(3088149, 431875, 29904, '<td valign="top">Lovely dof and simplicity!</td>', 'Lovely dof and simplicity!', '2006-12-05 02:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088166, 431354, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is placed too centrally.  Most things in nature are off-set and so the human eye tends to prefer things not centrally placed.  It would also show movement like the bird entering or leaving the field of vision.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'This is placed too centrally.  Most things in nature are off-set and so the human eye tends to prefer things not centrally placed.  It would also show movement like the bird entering or leaving the field of vision.  Hope that helps.', '2006-12-05 02:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088183, 432857, 29904, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Truely diagonal and one of my top picks.</td>', 'Lovely!  Truely diagonal and one of my top picks.', '2006-12-05 02:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088190, 432197, 29904, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, compelling.</td>', 'Excellent composition, compelling.', '2006-12-05 02:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088288, 432850, 69205, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea - the interplay of the positive space (the stem) with the negative space (the shadow of the petals).  I wonder if the petals could have been lit to make them disappear, so that only the shadow gave them away... Could the stamen have been included in the shot?<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice picture, that doesn''t do one corner to the other as the diagonal.</td>', 'This is a nice idea - the interplay of the positive space (the stem) with the negative space (the shadow of the petals).  I wonder if the petals could have been lit to make them disappear, so that only the shadow gave them away... Could the stamen have been included in the shot? Anyway, nice picture, that doesn''t do one corner to the other as the diagonal.', '2006-12-05 04:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088289, 432321, 69205, '<td valign="top">Yummy, yummy yummy.<br/> <br/>Are the segments resting on glass? (looking at the wet area on the right).</td>', 'Yummy, yummy yummy. Are the segments resting on glass? (looking at the wet area on the right).', '2006-12-05 04:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088293, 432684, 69205, '<td valign="top">Horizon not straight (sorry, it bugs me). Shame about the smog and the indistinct light on the far shore, on the other hand the red buoys with the stays make the shot. Cropping at the base of the leftmost bouy stay to exclude the left most pier/stay (the one without any red buoys) might be worth considering.</td>', 'Horizon not straight (sorry, it bugs me). Shame about the smog and the indistinct light on the far shore, on the other hand the red buoys with the stays make the shot. Cropping at the base of the leftmost bouy stay to exclude the left most pier/stay (the one without any red buoys) might be worth considering.', '2006-12-05 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088294, 432762, 69205, '<td valign="top">This is too funny.</td>', 'This is too funny.', '2006-12-05 04:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
