(3090988, 432662, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is a great image in and of itself. You''ve shown great skill and control of exposure here. Awesome. I can kinda understand RazorsEdge''s comment about the structure though. I wonder if it would have been a different outcome had you gotten closer to lose the buildings and tilted the camera ever-so-slightly for that diagonal "thrust"...? Just a thought. Great finish all the same, congrats on the neat score!</td>', 'This is a great image in and of itself. You''ve shown great skill and control of exposure here. Awesome. I can kinda understand RazorsEdge''s comment about the structure though. I wonder if it would have been a different outcome had you gotten closer to lose the buildings and tilted the camera ever-so-slightly for that diagonal "thrust"...? Just a thought. Great finish all the same, congrats on the neat score!', '2006-12-06 00:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3090989, 432081, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes yes yes, my pick for the "Blue", and so deserved with such a stunning image again Ursula. <br/>Definately Tops in my book, and my only "10" in this challenge.....</td>', 'Yes yes yes, my pick for the "Blue", and so deserved with such a stunning image again Ursula. Definately Tops in my book, and my only "10" in this challenge.....', '2006-12-06 00:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
