(3091054, 432571, 5112, '<td valign="top">Manny!  Congratulations on fourth, I am so pleased to for once have beat you :))))))  I guess I''m going by stereotypes, because I''ve never been outside of the Americas, but this looks so unlike Thailand.  All those leaves and the puddles, and the dark, old stone steps, make it look "northern" somehow, to my eyes.  There''s such a contrast between cold/warm here, the backdrop is all cold, the person has Summer clothing on and looks so warm.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Manny!  Congratulations on fourth, I am so pleased to for once have beat you :))))))  I guess I''m going by stereotypes, because I''ve never been outside of the Americas, but this looks so unlike Thailand.  All those leaves and the puddles, and the dark, old stone steps, make it look "northern" somehow, to my eyes.  There''s such a contrast between cold/warm here, the backdrop is all cold, the person has Summer clothing on and looks so warm.  Beautiful.', '2006-12-06 00:56:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3091055, 432503, 23430, '<td valign="top">Top shot. Well done to get 5th spot especially on your first challenge.</td>', 'Top shot. Well done to get 5th spot especially on your first challenge.', '2006-12-06 00:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
