(3093840, 432442, 38198, '<td valign="top">Good title, I like the clean look. I wonder where the plane is? It just drops off.</td>', 'Good title, I like the clean look. I wonder where the plane is? It just drops off.', '2006-12-06 17:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3093843, 432203, 67301, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 9 and I thought it was fantastic. The definition is superb and I felt the mans face has so much character. The only thing I can say in criticism is that the crop is tight but I liked it. I honestly can''t understand the 1-4 scores here. Even if someone did not appreciate the subject the quality of the shot has to be worth a 5-6 minimum.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 9 and I thought it was fantastic. The definition is superb and I felt the mans face has so much character. The only thing I can say in criticism is that the crop is tight but I liked it. I honestly can''t understand the 1-4 scores here. Even if someone did not appreciate the subject the quality of the shot has to be worth a 5-6 minimum.', '2006-12-06 17:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3093863, 430836, 38198, '<td valign="top">I think I''m falling... Good color and ex. Maybe the title could be changed. I think I would like it level but "dnmc".</td>', 'I think I''m falling... Good color and ex. Maybe the title could be changed. I think I would like it level but "dnmc".', '2006-12-06 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3093884, 431833, 38198, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like the real life of this. The color is wonderful. I like all the people on the street too. This is a good shot for this challenge. I think it should have been in the top 40, but that is just me.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like the real life of this. The color is wonderful. I like all the people on the street too. This is a good shot for this challenge. I think it should have been in the top 40, but that is just me.', '2006-12-06 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 0),
