(3093969, 431739, 41337, '<td valign="top">I must say the diagonal is excellent in this photo and it''s an interesting subject in it''s own right. Your problem here is not with those imbecile low voters but with the ones that gave you a 5. As Art said, those two things could have easily made a big impact on those voters and everyone else voting in an honest way.</td>', 'I must say the diagonal is excellent in this photo and it''s an interesting subject in it''s own right. Your problem here is not with those imbecile low voters but with the ones that gave you a 5. As Art said, those two things could have easily made a big impact on those voters and everyone else voting in an honest way.', '2006-12-06 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094030, 432888, 58590, '<td valign="top">Cindi''s kickin ass!!!!  Keep it up girl! :-)</td>', 'Cindi''s kickin ass!!!!  Keep it up girl! :-)', '2006-12-06 18:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094033, 431175, 37818, '<td valign="top">I almost shot here or diagonal, too!! Nice work !</td>', 'I almost shot here or diagonal, too!! Nice work !', '2006-12-06 18:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094044, 432888, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>No way.....Not with my very short solid oversized little legs.....</b> I have to get someones elses sexy legs and pretend they were mine.....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by samchad:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s funny - I think you''re legs are becoming famous - do they feature in every challenge nowadays?!  Maybe we should have a ''legs'' challenge. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'No way.....Not with my very short solid oversized little legs..... I have to get someones elses sexy legs and pretend they were mine..... Originally posted by samchad: It''s funny - I think you''re legs are becoming famous - do they feature in every challenge nowadays?!  Maybe we should have a ''legs'' challenge. ', '2006-12-06 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094048, 430633, 69387, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! This is a great shot, superb detail!</td>', 'Congratulations! This is a great shot, superb detail!', '2006-12-06 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094073, 432081, 69209, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  Caught my eye immediately.  Absolutely flawless in every way.  Well Deserving of the first place.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  Caught my eye immediately.  Absolutely flawless in every way.  Well Deserving of the first place.  Congratulations!', '2006-12-06 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094138, 432081, 29748, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  Congrats on such a beautiful photo.</td>', 'This is amazing!  Congrats on such a beautiful photo.', '2006-12-06 19:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094164, 432081, 37730, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-12-06 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094226, 432691, 66597, '<td valign="top">Raish,<br/>I gave this photo a 7, as I really like the interaction between the cats and the expression on the one cat''s face. I suspect some people were a little harsh because the photo is fairly dark, and often cats don''t do well in general. I agree with some of the other photos that a bit more light would have made a big difference.</td>', 'Raish,I gave this photo a 7, as I really like the interaction between the cats and the expression on the one cat''s face. I suspect some people were a little harsh because the photo is fairly dark, and often cats don''t do well in general. I agree with some of the other photos that a bit more light would have made a big difference.', '2006-12-06 19:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094233, 431265, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne,<br/>I think you have very interesting perspective in this photo. On my monitor the blacks look a bit green, which may just be my monitor. I would like to see a bit more of the detail in the wheel, but it looks like it was a pretty difficult subject to light! Nice job.</td>', 'Julianne,I think you have very interesting perspective in this photo. On my monitor the blacks look a bit green, which may just be my monitor. I would like to see a bit more of the detail in the wheel, but it looks like it was a pretty difficult subject to light! Nice job.', '2006-12-06 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094239, 431536, 66597, '<td valign="top">I expected this would score a bit higher. I think the lines are nice, the focus is crisp, and the colors are lovely.</td>', 'I expected this would score a bit higher. I think the lines are nice, the focus is crisp, and the colors are lovely.', '2006-12-06 19:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094250, 432442, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this photo. I think this would be interesting as part of a triptych (spelling?) showing the plane as well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this photo. I think this would be interesting as part of a triptych (spelling?) showing the plane as well.', '2006-12-06 19:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094254, 430836, 66597, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me as a titled image - I think the reason is that there is a lot of detail in the photo, with the trees and shadows, so it is difficult to pinpoint a subject to latch onto. I would really like to see this straight, as the road has a lovely curve.</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me as a titled image - I think the reason is that there is a lot of detail in the photo, with the trees and shadows, so it is difficult to pinpoint a subject to latch onto. I would really like to see this straight, as the road has a lovely curve.', '2006-12-06 19:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094262, 431833, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/>I''m loving your Germany photos. I gave this a 10. In fact, it was one of my faves of the challenge. I love the vanishing point and I think you did an excellent job controlling the lighting, which could have easily gotten blown on the cobblestones. Great shot!</td>', 'Deb,I''m loving your Germany photos. I gave this a 10. In fact, it was one of my faves of the challenge. I love the vanishing point and I think you did an excellent job controlling the lighting, which could have easily gotten blown on the cobblestones. Great shot!', '2006-12-06 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094266, 432615, 66597, '<td valign="top">Svetlana,<br/>Another beautiful and captivating image! You have a lot of talent, I think. The lighting and composition work very well together. Great job.</td>', 'Svetlana,Another beautiful and captivating image! You have a lot of talent, I think. The lighting and composition work very well together. Great job.', '2006-12-06 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094270, 432309, 66597, '<td valign="top">The curve of the salamandar''s body and water droplets are beautiful. Congratulations on your 6+ finish, very much deserved!</td>', 'The curve of the salamandar''s body and water droplets are beautiful. Congratulations on your 6+ finish, very much deserved!', '2006-12-06 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094274, 432325, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely image that some voters perhaps had trouble fitting into the challenge. I gave it a 6, and honestly probably would have scored it higher in a different challenge. You did a very good job with the colors and saturation.</td>', 'I think this is a lovely image that some voters perhaps had trouble fitting into the challenge. I gave it a 6, and honestly probably would have scored it higher in a different challenge. You did a very good job with the colors and saturation.', '2006-12-06 19:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094280, 431287, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 6+ finish! The clouds add a lot of interest to this photo, and the curve of the frond is very strong.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 6+ finish! The clouds add a lot of interest to this photo, and the curve of the frond is very strong.', '2006-12-06 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3094326, 431797, 38198, '<td valign="top">I think it is best when viewed from away. When I stand back or look at the TN I see the lines the best. I feel the need to ps the writing off the window, may get a dq for that in this challenge. Over all I think it is a good shot, like the color and the design of the lines.</td>', 'I think it is best when viewed from away. When I stand back or look at the TN I see the lines the best. I feel the need to ps the writing off the window, may get a dq for that in this challenge. Over all I think it is a good shot, like the color and the design of the lines.', '2006-12-06 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
