(3098807, 432650, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, Brad.  We have a hunk of tree on a guy wire for a power pole in our neighborhood.  I walk past it every day. :)</td>', 'Cool shot, Brad.  We have a hunk of tree on a guy wire for a power pole in our neighborhood.  I walk past it every day. :)', '2006-12-08 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099160, 432718, 18207, '<td valign="top">Nem, az igazi klisé a másik oldalról lõve lenne. :) Szép.<br/>No, it would be cliche shot from the other side of the river. :) Very nice.<br/> <br/>(For most of you: the other side gives an upper viewpoint, bringing the Parliament in the background, everyone shoots that. I\''d also like to mention that the lighting conditions there are so hard for a photog, Milo did a great work to present the bridge in these natural colors.)</td>', 'Nem, az igazi klisé a másik oldalról lõve lenne. :) Szép.No, it would be cliche shot from the other side of the river. :) Very nice. (For most of you: the other side gives an upper viewpoint, bringing the Parliament in the background, everyone shoots that. I\''d also like to mention that the lighting conditions there are so hard for a photog, Milo did a great work to present the bridge in these natural colors.)', '2006-12-08 06:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099394, 432327, 69008, '<td valign="top">I see a vertical component in the glass that is in the curved beams, which anchors the vertical axis for this pic. I didn''t lock in on that until I looked at it again this morning.  I was in London in 99 for a "Scrapheap Challenge/Junkyard  Wars" filming. Beautiful city with a wonderful combination of old and new architecture. Deserves the ribbon. I wonder if it''s Brit humor that the largest most high profile piece of architecture in the city is named "Canary?"</td>', 'I see a vertical component in the glass that is in the curved beams, which anchors the vertical axis for this pic. I didn''t lock in on that until I looked at it again this morning.  I was in London in 99 for a "Scrapheap Challenge/Junkyard  Wars" filming. Beautiful city with a wonderful combination of old and new architecture. Deserves the ribbon. I wonder if it''s Brit humor that the largest most high profile piece of architecture in the city is named "Canary?"', '2006-12-08 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099513, 432327, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow man, congrats.  Ditto what I said in original comments.</td>', 'Wow man, congrats.  Ditto what I said in original comments.', '2006-12-08 10:07:20.000000', NULL, 0),
