(3099660, 432081, 5112, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hopper:</b></div><hr/><i> 1 more ribbon ties you with Heida for "top dpc female"<br/> <br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you!  Only because Heida quit entering challenges, otherwise I wouldn''t have a chance :)</td>', 'Originally posted by hopper: 1 more ribbon ties you with Heida for "top dpc female" :)   Thank you!  Only because Heida quit entering challenges, otherwise I wouldn''t have a chance :)', '2006-12-08 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099849, 432514, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by e301:</b></div><hr/><i> Strong compositional sense - and that alone sets this apart in this challenge - aand good solid technicals. I can''t see that its involving enough, either on a human or a spectacular level to well here, and even allowing for the manner in which the handrail takes the eye away in a nice dynamic against the actual direction of the stairs, it lacks, for me, something more to really engage attention. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for this comment. I fully agree with the pointed out cons. It is very useful to receive comments from someone how is able to see and explain these kind of things.</td>', 'Originally posted by e301: Strong compositional sense - and that alone sets this apart in this challenge - aand good solid technicals. I can''t see that its involving enough, either on a human or a spectacular level to well here, and even allowing for the manner in which the handrail takes the eye away in a nice dynamic against the actual direction of the stairs, it lacks, for me, something more to really engage attention.   Thanks for this comment. I fully agree with the pointed out cons. It is very useful to receive comments from someone how is able to see and explain these kind of things.', '2006-12-08 12:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099870, 432514, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pekesty:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice shadow and light that works very well with this interesting composition.  Small complaint is the upper right corner.  Nicely done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for your comment. From the pics in your portfolio I could tell you like vintage cars. Same here. I am a collector/restorer I wish theres was a challenge about vintage cars.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 13:40:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by pekesty: Very nice shadow and light that works very well with this interesting composition.  Small complaint is the upper right corner.  Nicely done!  Thanks for your comment. From the pics in your portfolio I could tell you like vintage cars. Same here. I am a collector/restorer I wish theres was a challenge about vintage cars.', '2006-12-08 12:59:10.000000', '2006-12-08 13:40:43.000000', 0),
