(3131123, 432626, 69008, '<td valign="top">I had no trouble at all connecting the dots to make this diagonal.  Like J.P. said, see if you can scrub out the bright spots, at least the ones under his ear. The leaves are ok with me. I like the border idea too.  Best wishes to the couple.</td>', 'I had no trouble at all connecting the dots to make this diagonal.  Like J.P. said, see if you can scrub out the bright spots, at least the ones under his ear. The leaves are ok with me. I like the border idea too.  Best wishes to the couple.', '2006-12-19 10:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
