(3153859, 432872, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic/graphic coloring on this one.  It''s nice to see a photographer taking advantage of the wires instead of havign to clone them out.  <br/> <br/>My only suggestion would be to rotate it (either in shooting or pp) so that the tower is in the corner, straddling, so to speak, the bottom and left sides.  Then, it would also be on a diagonal, as well as the wires.<br/> <br/>Of course, I''m kinda tilted as well.  <br/> <br/>great work!</td>', 'I like the dramatic/graphic coloring on this one.  It''s nice to see a photographer taking advantage of the wires instead of havign to clone them out.   My only suggestion would be to rotate it (either in shooting or pp) so that the tower is in the corner, straddling, so to speak, the bottom and left sides.  Then, it would also be on a diagonal, as well as the wires. Of course, I''m kinda tilted as well.   great work!', '2006-12-27 15:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
