(3218618, 430678, 61138, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. And contrary to what some others might say...I like that the background figures are out of focus. It adds an element of mystery. Are they as attractive as the woman in front? Who decided the order? Was there conflict or argument over position? The questions give the photo, the subjects and the photographer a life outside the frame.<br/> <br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. And contrary to what some others might say...I like that the background figures are out of focus. It adds an element of mystery. Are they as attractive as the woman in front? Who decided the order? Was there conflict or argument over position? The questions give the photo, the subjects and the photographer a life outside the frame. Nicely done.', '2007-01-12 11:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
