(3541840, 431540, 76926, '<td valign="top">Siggav,<br/> <br/>You''ve inspired me with your photography. I recently got a D50 with a 24-85mm zoom and am enjoying the camera. I have also just purchased a used MF Nikkor 50mm f/1.8 AIS on ebay for $40 (US dollars)and will have it shipped to me in about a week. <br/> <br/>Any chance you could give me a few tips on using this MF Nikkor 50mm f/1.8 AIS lens, since I won''t be able to us it on the auto exposure setting or with auto focus. I hear it is a great lens, but I would like to know the best way to use it on the D50.<br/> <br/>I just registered on dpchallenge a few minutes ago, so I haven''t looked into posting any photos yet.<br/> <br/>Thanks a bunch. Keep up with the great photos!<br/></td>', 'Siggav, You''ve inspired me with your photography. I recently got a D50 with a 24-85mm zoom and am enjoying the camera. I have also just purchased a used MF Nikkor 50mm f/1.8 AIS on ebay for $40 (US dollars)and will have it shipped to me in about a week.  Any chance you could give me a few tips on using this MF Nikkor 50mm f/1.8 AIS lens, since I won''t be able to us it on the auto exposure setting or with auto focus. I hear it is a great lens, but I would like to know the best way to use it on the D50. I just registered on dpchallenge a few minutes ago, so I haven''t looked into posting any photos yet. Thanks a bunch. Keep up with the great photos!', '2007-04-12 03:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
